{"id":8337,"name":"Oakland County","slug":"oakland-county","state":"Michigan","code":"MI","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/michigan-tax-deed-sales-property-deals-90-off/oakland-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-20T14:50:41","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Deed Sale","bidProcedure":"Premium Bid","deposit":"$1,000","redemptionPeriod":"N/A (since this is a deed sale)","interestRate":"Not applicable for deed sales","extra":[{"label":"Typical Date of Sale","value":"August – October"},{"label":"Sale Contact","value":"Oakland County Treasurer’s Office"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"tax-sale.info"},{"label":"County Website","value":"Oakland County Official Site"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"fULvarQBHl9m9l24bytJsRjTmiubpenA00zxrDXkIoCA55RPhKvgziPojqUJQpkcZWYq2G6d8Wc6L7ZayN3FEw7\"><iframe title=\"Homes and Land for 40-90% Less - Oakland County - Michigan Tax Deed Investing\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/b0bfY0lw5b0?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Homes-and-Land-for-40-90%-Less---Oakland-County---Michigan-Tax-Deed-Investing\">Homes and Land for 40-90% Less in Oakland County, Michigan</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Get properties for as much as 90% off market value with Oakland County, Michigan&#8217;s Tax Foreclosed Property Sale. This online auction lets you save big and invest smartly from home. Start by creating an account at <a href=\"https://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Michigan Public Land Auction</mark></a> and get pre-authorized with a simple $1,000 credit card hold.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-how-it-works\">How It Works:</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Advance Bidding:</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Place and adjust your bids before the auction begins.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Active Bidding:</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Participate in live competition with real-time feedback on bid standings.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>No Reserve Auctions:</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Submit your best final offers in a sealed bid format, giving you a chance to win properties for less than your maximum bid.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Details\">Important Details</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Oakland-County-Michigan-Courthouse.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Oakland-County-Michigan-Courthouse-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Oakland-County-Michigan-Courthouse-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Oakland-County-Michigan-Courthouse-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Oakland-County-Michigan-Courthouse-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Oakland-County-Michigan-Courthouse-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Oakland-County-Michigan-Courthouse.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Oakland-County-Michigan-Courthouse.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Oakland-County-Michigan-Courthouse-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Oakland-County-Michigan-Courthouse-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Oakland-County-Michigan-Courthouse-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Oakland-County-Michigan-Courthouse-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Oakland-County-Michigan-Courthouse-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-17701 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Oakland County Michigan Courthouse\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Steps-to-Start-Investing\">Steps to Start Investing in Oakland County</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Research and Understand Local Laws:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>It&#8217;s crucial to know the legal framework in Oakland County. Key regulations include the three-year tax delinquency process leading to foreclosure and auction.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Visit the Local Treasurer&#8217;s Website:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Find detailed tax deed sale information on the <a href=\"https://www.oakgov.com/government/oakland-county-treasurer-s-office/purchase-property/land-sale\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Oakland County Treasurer&#8217;s Office page</mark></a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Check the Auction Site:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>The auction is held on <a href=\"https://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">tax-sale.info</mark></a>. Here, you can participate in advance and active bidding phases.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Read Details about Tax Deeds:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Understand the sale schedule, parcel inquiry, and other essential details to make informed bids.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Contact the County Office:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>For any additional inquiries, reach out to the<mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\"> </mark><a href=\"https://www.oakgov.com/government/oakland-county-treasurer-s-office\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Oakland County Treasurer&#8217;s Office</mark></a><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">.</mark></p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"FAQs\">FAQs</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>How do I participate in the auction?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Create an account on <a href=\"https://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">tax-sale.info</mark></a> and get pre-authorized with a $1,000 credit card hold.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>What is the bidding process?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Advance bidding starts 30 days before the auction date, where you can place and modify bids. Active bidding on the auction day provides real-time updates until 7 PM.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>What happens if I win a bid?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>You will receive an email with payment instructions within an hour after the auction ends. Payment must be completed promptly to finalize your purchase.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Are there additional costs?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Yes, the winning bid amount will include a $30 deed recording fee, a 10% buyer&#8217;s premium, and any current real property taxes.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Useful-Links\">Useful Links for Oakland County Tax Deed Investing</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.oakgov.com/government/oakland-county-treasurer-s-office\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Oakland County Treasurer&#8217;s Office</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Michigan Public Land Auction</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.oakgov.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Oakland County Official Site</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Need-a-Hand?\">Need a Hand?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>If you need assistance and guidance with tax